zig-stb-image is a translation to Zig of stb_image 2.30 by Sean Barrett and
its contributors (https://github.com/nothings/stb). It is offered under the
same two licences as the original, quoted from its stb_image.h with the
translation's copyright line added. Choose whichever you prefer.

