src/pow.zig and src/pow_tables.zig are a translation to Zig of pow from
Arm's optimized-routines (https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines),
the code glibc's pow is built from. The files they translate carry the
notices "Copyright (c) 2018-2026, Arm Limited." (math/pow.c), "Copyright (c)
2018, Arm Limited." (math/pow_log_data.c) and "Copyright (c) 2018-2023, Arm
Limited." (math/exp_data.c). optimized-routines is licensed MIT OR
Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; the translation is used under the MIT
licence, as optimized-routines gives it:

